* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_stc3 (20 Nov 2026): a three-stage event tree (stages.stc L26-141).
* Stage 2 starts in 2015 with two SOWs; stage 3 in 2030, with two sub-states given only for SOW 1 of
* stage 2, so SOW 2's are copied from it (SW_COPY, SW_CPMAP), with their probabilities and data. The
* missing probability of SOW 2 at stage 3 is filled (1 - 0.7). Cumulative limits by stage and SOW:
* REG1's transport CO2 (S_COM_CUMNET) and the gas into industry (S_FLO_CUM), with SUPERYR.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER SW_START /
2 2015
3 2030
/;
PARAMETER SW_SUBS /
1.1 2
2.1 2
/;
PARAMETER SW_SPROB /
2.1 0.6
2.2 0.4
3.1 0.7
/;
PARAMETER S_COM_PROJ /
REG1.2020.DRSH.2.2 1.05
REG1.2030.DTCAR.3.1 1.1
REG1.2030.DTCAR.3.2 0.95
/;
PARAMETER S_COM_CUMNET /
REG1.2015.2050.TRACO2.UP.3.1 24000000
/;
PARAMETER S_FLO_CUM /
REG1.FTE-INDGAS.GAS.2015.2050.UP.2.2 65000
/;
